discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Critical]** TOCTOU race: early `inFlightSessionIds.has()` (line 1303) is read-only — it never calls `add()`. The authoritative `add()` happens here, after ~290 lines of conditional async branch/worktree work. Two concurrent `POST /session` requests with the same `sessionId` can both pass the early check (set is empty), then Request A (no branch/worktree) races through to this late check, adds, spawns, completes, and its `finally` block removes the id. When Request B (with async branch/worktree work) reaches this point, the set is empty again — B passes and reaches `loadCliConfig` → `process.exit(1)` at `config.ts:1991`, killing **every** session on the shared ACP channel.

Failure scenario: fast request A completes and cleans up before slow request B reaches the late guard → B bypasses both guards → `process.exit(1)` terminates the shared ACP child → all sessions destroyed.

```suggestion
    // Authoritative in-flight reservation: synchronous check-and-add
    // (no await between) so the finally below always cleans up.
    if (requestedSessionId !== undefined) {
      if (inFlightSessionIds.has(requestedSessionId)) {
        res.status(409).json({
          error: `Session "${requestedSessionId}" creation already in progress`,
          code: 'session_id_conflict',
        });
        return;
      }
      inFlightSessionIds.add(requestedSessionId);
    }
```

**Fix:** Move `inFlightSessionIds.add()` to immediately after the early `has()` check at line 1303 (before any `await`), making it a synchronous check-and-add. The existing `finally` block handles cleanup.

<details>
<summary>中文说明</summary>

**[Critical]** TOCTOU 竞态：早期 `inFlightSessionIds.has()`（第 1303 行）仅做读取检查，从不调用 `add()`。权威的 `add()` 在此处执行，但前面有约 290 行条件性异步 branch/worktree 创建。两个并发 `POST /session` 请求使用相同 `sessionId` 都能通过早期检查（集合为空），随后请求 A（无 branch/worktree）快速到达此处、添加、生成会话并完成，其 `finally` 块将 id 从集合中移除。当请求 B（有异步 branch/worktree 工作）到达此处时，集合再次为空——B 通过检查并到达 `loadCliConfig` → `process.exit(1)`，杀死共享 ACP 子进程上的**所有**会话。

修复：将 `inFlightSessionIds.add()` 移至第 1303 行的早期 `has()` 检查之后（在任何 `await` 之前），使其成为同步的检查并添加。

</details>

