discussion_comments.comment_body:
**[Suggestion]** `outputWrites` is only awaited on the success path — if `pumpInputToPty` throws, pending stdout writes are abandoned — Failure scenario: The PTY emits output data (queued in `outputWrites`), and nearly simultaneously the input pump throws. The bridge skips `await outputWrites`, runs `finally` cleanup, and propagates the error. In the caller, `restoreRawMode()` runs while pending stdout writes are still in flight. The writes complete after terminal mode restoration, potentially producing garbled display (control characters interpreted in cooked mode).

```suggestion
  try {
    const reason = await pumpInputToPty(
      options.stdin,
      options.pty,
      bridgeAbort.signal,
    );
    await outputWrites;
    return { reason };
  } finally {
    bridgeAbort.abort();
    try { await outputWrites; } catch { /* chain's .catch handles rejections */ }
```

<details><summary>中文说明</summary>

`outputWrites` 只在成功路径上被 await。如果 `pumpInputToPty` 抛出异常，待处理的 stdout 写入会被放弃，可能在终端模式恢复后才完成，导致显示乱码。建议在 `finally` 块中也 drain `outputWrites`。

</details>

